ding accuracy value as the lowest performer. Baseline methods that flatten visual information often misinterpret spatial relationships. They frequently conflate nearby components. RAG-Anything’s structured representation preserves critical visual-textual associations. This leads to accurate query resolution and proper attribution of performance drops to \"-S-A\".\nImage Path: /Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/parsed/rag-anything-handson-v1/mineru/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025_4ae5f35e/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025/auto/images/84aeb4bd1fae215b505273557de97339f2993ac9df2ff758f47d3309f79979d1.jpg
